Rook 0.4.0-M4 build tree, private Xvfb :122 + Openbox.

1. Ctrl+L, typed http://127.0.0.1:8781/form.html, Return.
   window title -> "Profile form - Rook".
2. Clicked name field (xdotool --window <rook> 431 229), typed "Jay Gupta".
   field shows "Jay Gupta"; screenshots/05-typed-name.png.
3. Ctrl+L, Escape, typed "X".
   field becomes "Jay GuptaX"; screenshots/06-after-escape.png.

The first-review blocker (click page, type, nothing reaches the page) is gone.
